                            <comment id="16123316" author="andrey-kuznetsov" created="Fri, 11 Aug 2017 13:10:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Blocking compute jobs leaded to compute threads exhausting, and to deadlock, consequently. Fixed by limiting blocking (&quot;consumer&quot;) job count by value less than total compute thread count.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=DmitriyGovorukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;DmitriyGovorukhin&quot;&gt;DmitriyGovorukhin&lt;/a&gt;, please review my changes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16128588" author="dmitriygovorukhin" created="Wed, 16 Aug 2017 10:04:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=andrey-kuznetsov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;andrey-kuznetsov&quot;&gt;andrey-kuznetsov&lt;/a&gt; I reviewed your change, looks good for me, thank for contribution. Somebody, please merge in master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16135163" author="agura" created="Mon, 21 Aug 2017 13:20:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=andrey-kuznetsov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;andrey-kuznetsov&quot;&gt;andrey-kuznetsov&lt;/a&gt; Thanks for contribution! Merged to master branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
